    {
      "id": "symbol:AGENTS.md:cf6142a",
      "type": "Symbol",
      "content": "chunk chunk: Usage guidance (exported) @AGENTS.md:36",
      "metadata": {
        "name": "chunk: Usage guidance",
        "kind": "chunk",
        "exported": true,
        "line": 36,
        "file": "AGENTS.md",
        "signature": "- Ask GraphFlow to plan before broad changes: `graphflow_plan`.\n- Ask GraphFlow to compress and anchor code context: `graphflow_context`.\n- Always pass `rootDir` = this project's absolute path. **Never** pass your home directory, AppData, or an unexpanded `${workspaceFolder}` placeholder — GraphFlow refuses unsafe workspace roots. If a call answers `unsafe workspace root`, retry the same call without `rootDir` (the server then uses its configured workspace).\n- Ask GraphFlow to inspect graph state or skill learnings when the repo history matters.\n- After executing work from a `graphflow_run` `executionDescriptor`, **must** call `graphflow_report_outcome` with the `episodeId` from the run result, a `success` boolean, and optional `lessons` to close the skill flywheel loop.\n- Fall back to `graphflow ... --json` only if MCP is not available (including `graphflow --json outcome report <episodeId> <success>`).\n\nDeepSeek Harness: `dsh plugin --profile web add @roarpeng/graphflow` (or `npx @roarpeng/graphflow install` when `~/.dsh` exists).\n<!-- GRAPHFLOW:END -->",
        "signatureHash": "2076ab9",
        "embeddingQ": {
          "format": "int8-v1",
          "scale": 0.0042860712909591914,
          "data": [
