        "bodyTerms": "package server import bytes net http path filepath strings sync time kerrors github com kratos errors log khttp transport bishop9910 blog backend internal conf service web webhandler handler answers every request that api route uploaded file claimed has two jobs look alike but must not confused unknown paths get json error the frontend apierror machinery works while page index html vue router can resolve deep links type struct files tree either copy embedded binary directory disk both cases through everything below written once nil means this process serves only assets memoises bodies names actually exist are stored client inventing cannot grow map string byte staticurl static url upload prefix also never spa helper func newwebhandler new cfg config logger return frontendfs trimspace trim space staticdir dir normaliseprefix normalise data uploadurl decides what pages normal deployment carries dist all explicit still wins when usable which makes possible iterate against built configured missing holds falls back rather than disabling outright returning keeps serving code identical for sources and sidesteps dirfs style handling mistakes since embed reject escapes root abs err switch case warnf unusable using isfile join default infof from warn notfound found res responsewriter response writer req handlepreflight handle preflight isreserved reserved defaulterrorencoder encoder not_found servepage serve methodnotallowed method allowed statusmethodnotallowed status method_not_allowed closes out cors matches specific always lands one handlers above headers were already added filter bool methodoptions options false writeheader write header statusnocontent content true urlpath hasprefix apiprefix returns real exists otherwise leading slash before clean safe resolved result escape relative trimprefix body asset writeasset sends modtime deliberately zero have timestamp download updated under running claiming modification would produce wrong 304s freshness