        "symbolCount": 14,
        "sizeBytes": 6245,
        "bodyTerms": "package conf holds the disk configuration schema for blog server file intentionally small and human editable everything has working default backend configs config yaml may deleted entirely will still start import fmt time gopkg duration lets say readtimeout read timeout 60s instead bare number nanoseconds which what plain field would require type unmarshalyaml unmarshal implements unmarshaler func node error var raw string err decode nil return parsed parseduration parse errorf not valid std converts back use with standard library whole tree struct serverconfig data dataconfig auth authconfig cors corsconfig log logconfig covers http listener addr listen address bounds how long request body take arrive writetimeout write must generous image uploads stream through idletimeout idle keep alive window maxbodybytes max bytes caps bodies included int64 staticdir static dir overrides frontend embedded binary empty means serve copy makes release single executable path that missing index html also falls stale setting cannot site down point real directory dist iterate without rebuilding deep links fall spa router can resolve them carrying serves api only points storage database sqlite created uploaddir upload where uploaded images are written uploadurl url public prefix those files served under maxuploadbytes configures password lock secret jwt signing key left random generated once persisted next tokens survive restarts secretfile cached tokenttl token ttl login lasts bcryptcost bcrypt cost hashing work factor allows int setuptoken setup reserved requiring shared post fresh deployment claimed whichever stranger reaches port first enforced yet handler reads deliberately absent from value there sit git tracked looking like protection does exist lists browser origins allowed call enabled bool allowedorigins controls verbosity level one debug info warn returns used when present second hour true localhost load falling defaults any keeps its partial cfg readfile switch case isnotexist supported state complete reading over unspecified keys parsing validate reports nonsensical values early rather than between got positive"
      }
