    {
      "id": "symbol:.graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md:f298cdda",
      "type": "Symbol",
      "content": "chunk chunk: GraphFlow Skill (exported) @.graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md:5",
      "metadata": {
        "name": "chunk: GraphFlow Skill",
        "kind": "chunk",
        "exported": true,
        "line": 5,
        "file": ".graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md",
        "signature": "# GraphFlow Skill\n\nGraphFlow is a graph-based context and planning service backed by a persistent MCP server. It turns codebases into queryable knowledge graphs, delivering token-efficient compressed context, task planning, and orchestration.",
        "signatureHash": "610794c6"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "symbol:.graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md:f5a51b46",
      "type": "Symbol",
      "content": "chunk chunk: Architecture (exported) @.graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md:11",
      "metadata": {
        "name": "chunk: Architecture",
        "kind": "chunk",
        "exported": true,
        "line": 11,
        "file": ".graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md",
        "signature": "```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  GraphFlow Skill (this file)                     │\n│  - Quick entry points & workflows                │\n│  - Tool selection logic                          │\n│  - Output interpretation guides                  │\n└──────────────────┬──────────────────────────────┘\n                   │\n                   ▼\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  GraphFlow MCP Server (persistent backend)      │\n│  10 tools: context, plan, index, insight, run,  │\n│  report_outcome, skill_insights, diagnose,      │\n│  artifact, skill_guide                          │\n└──────────────────┬──────────────────────────────┘\n                   │\n                   ▼\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│  GraphFlow Core Engine                          │\n│  - Graph index & context compression            │\n│  - Task planning & DAG                          │\n│  - Skill learning flywheel                      │\n│  - Artifact import/export                       │\n└─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```",
        "signatureHash": "661b88a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "symbol:.graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md:472b7d95",
      "type": "Symbol",
      "content": "chunk chunk: When to Use (exported) @.graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md:39",
      "metadata": {
        "name": "chunk: When to Use",
        "kind": "chunk",
        "exported": true,
        "line": 39,
        "file": ".graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md",
        "signature": "**ALWAYS invoke this skill BEFORE:**\n- Multi-step edits, refactors, or architecture changes\n- Large codebase-wide questions or exploration\n- Debugging across multiple files\n- Any task where you would otherwise read many files\n- Token budget is a concern\n- You need structured task planning\n\n**DO NOT:**\n- Scan the whole repository recursively before trying GraphFlow\n- Read large files before checking GraphFlow anchors\n- Skip GraphFlow for complex tasks\n- Use grep for codebase exploration before `graphflow_context`",
        "signatureHash": "c190406c"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "symbol:.graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md:eea46dbc",
      "type": "Symbol",
      "content": "chunk chunk: Workspace root (`rootDir`) (exported) @.graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md:55",
      "metadata": {
        "name": "chunk: Workspace root (`rootDir`)",
        "kind": "chunk",
        "exported": true,
        "line": 55,
        "file": ".graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md",
        "signature": "Every tool resolves its workspace from, in order: the `rootDir` argument, `GRAPHFLOW_WORKSPACE_ROOT`, project config, then discovery from the process cwd.\n\n- Pass `rootDir` = the **absolute path of the project you are working in**.\n- **Never** pass your home directory, AppData, a bundled runtime directory, or an unexpanded `${workspaceFolder}` placeholder. GraphFlow refuses unsafe roots (`unsafe workspace root`) instead of indexing them, so the call fails.\n- On `unsafe workspace root`: retry the **same call without `rootDir`** (the server then uses its configured workspace / discovery) or with the session's project path. Do not retry the same unsafe path.\n- If the host started the MCP server from your home directory, set `GRAPHFLOW_WORKSPACE_ROOT` to the project path in its MCP server config.",
        "signatureHash": "ab39ded3"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "symbol:.graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md:e8ed23c3",
      "type": "Symbol",
      "content": "chunk chunk: Trae / Trae CN setup (Rules + Skill + MCP) (exported) @.graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md:64",
      "metadata": {
        "name": "chunk: Trae / Trae CN setup (Rules + Skill + MCP)",
        "kind": "chunk",
        "exported": true,
        "line": 64,
        "file": ".graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md",
        "signature": "Trae loads **Rules every turn** and **Skills on demand**. GraphFlow `install` writes:\n\n| Path | Role |\n|------|------|\n| `.trae/rules/graphflow.md` | `alwaysApply: true` — **must** call `graphflow_context` first |\n| `.trae/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md` | Full workflows; trigger with `#graphflow` |\n| `User/mcp.json` | GraphFlow MCP server |\n\nIf Rules are missing, type `#graphflow` at the start of a chat. Pass `rootDir` = current project absolute path on every context call.",
        "signatureHash": "fa431fef"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "symbol:.graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md:2cc53c39",
      "type": "Symbol",
      "content": "chunk chunk: Antigravity IDE setup (Rules + Skill + MCP) (exported) @.graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md:76",
      "metadata": {
        "name": "chunk: Antigravity IDE setup (Rules + Skill + MCP)",
        "kind": "chunk",
        "exported": true,
        "line": 76,
        "file": ".graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md",
        "signature": "| Path | Role |\n|------|------|\n| `~/.gemini/antigravity/mcp_config.json` | Global MCP (`mcpServers.graphflow`) |\n| `~/.gemini/antigravity/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md` | Global Skill |\n| `.agent/rules/graphflow.md` | Project rules (always loaded in workspace) |\n| `.agent/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md` | Project Skill |\n| `GEMINI.md` (project root) | Managed token-first block |\n\nRun `npx @roarpeng/graphflow install` from the project root. Do **not** hardcode `GRAPHFLOW_WORKSPACE_ROOT` in MCP env.",
        "signatureHash": "48471ee8"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "symbol:.graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md:187f4ba5",
      "type": "Symbol",
      "content": "chunk chunk: Gemini CLI setup (exported) @.graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md:88",
      "metadata": {
        "name": "chunk: Gemini CLI setup",
        "kind": "chunk",
        "exported": true,
        "line": 88,
        "file": ".graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md",
        "signature": "| Path | Role |\n|------|------|\n| `~/.gemini/settings.json` | MCP (`mcpServers.graphflow`) |\n| `~/.gemini/GEMINI.md` | Global managed instruction block |\n| `GEMINI.md` (project root) | Project managed block (with `install --scope all`) |",
        "signatureHash": "e9fc889e"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "symbol:.graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md:330529c0",
      "type": "Symbol",
      "content": "chunk chunk: GitHub Copilot (VS Code) setup (exported) @.graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md:96",
      "metadata": {
        "name": "chunk: GitHub Copilot (VS Code) setup",
        "kind": "chunk",
        "exported": true,
        "line": 96,
        "file": ".graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md",
        "signature": "| Path | Role |\n|------|------|\n| `~/.config/Code/User/mcp.json` | User MCP (`servers.graphflow`) |\n| `.vscode/mcp.json` | Project MCP (optional, team-shared) |\n| `.github/copilot-instructions.md` | Repo-level Copilot instructions |",
        "signatureHash": "31eaf7c"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "symbol:.graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md:42fe9d1d",
      "type": "Symbol",
      "content": "chunk chunk: Kimi Code CLI setup (exported) @.graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md:104",
      "metadata": {
        "name": "chunk: Kimi Code CLI setup",
        "kind": "chunk",
        "exported": true,
        "line": 104,
        "file": ".graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md",
        "signature": "| Path | Role |\n|------|------|\n| `~/.kimi-code/mcp.json` (or `$KIMI_CODE_HOME/mcp.json`) | User MCP (`mcpServers.graphflow`) |\n| `~/.kimi-code/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md` | User Skill (`/skill:graphflow`) |\n| `~/.kimi-code/AGENTS.md` | Global token-first instruction block |\n\nRun `npx @roarpeng/graphflow install`. Kimi Code does not expand `${workspaceFolder}`; GraphFlow omits that env placeholder. Tools appear as `mcp__graphflow__graphflow_*`. HostAdapter id: `kimi-code`.",
        "signatureHash": "eb3b3ed2"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "symbol:.graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md:37d5a34c",
      "type": "Symbol",
      "content": "chunk chunk: DeepSeek Harness（`dsh`）插件：用法与能力 (exported) @.graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md:114",
      "metadata": {
        "name": "chunk: DeepSeek Harness（`dsh`）插件：用法与能力",
        "kind": "chunk",
        "exported": true,
        "line": 114,
        "file": ".graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md",
        "signature": "GraphFlow 是 DeepSeek Harness 的 `dsh-plugin`。装入后模型看到的工具名带前缀 `mcp__graphflow__`。\n\n**能力**\n\n| 能力 | 工具（dsh 名） |\n|------|----------------|\n| 压缩上下文（先调用） | `mcp__graphflow__graphflow_context` |\n| 任务规划 DAG | `mcp__graphflow__graphflow_plan` |\n| 桥接执行包 | `mcp__graphflow__graphflow_run` |\n| 回填飞轮 | `mcp__graphflow__graphflow_report_outcome` |\n| ATP insight | `mcp__graphflow__graphflow_insight` |\n| 增量/全量建图 | `mcp__graphflow__graphflow_index` |\n| 技能洞察 | `mcp__graphflow__graphflow_skill_insights` |\n| 诊断 | `mcp__graphflow__graphflow_diagnose` |\n| 图谱产物 | `mcp__graphflow__graphflow_artifact` |\n| 技能指南 | `mcp__graphflow__graphflow_skill_guide` |\n\n**安装**\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add @roarpeng/graphflow\nnpx @deepseek-ai/dsh web",
        "signatureHash": "ee30271a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "symbol:.graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md:f7e95df5",
      "type": "Symbol",
      "content": "chunk chunk: 或已有 ~/.dsh 时写 home overlay + skill 文件： (exported) @.graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md:138",
      "metadata": {
        "name": "chunk: 或已有 ~/.dsh 时写 home overlay + skill 文件：",
        "kind": "chunk",
        "exported": true,
        "line": 138,
        "file": ".graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md",
        "signature": "npx @roarpeng/graphflow install\n```\n\n| 路径 | 作用 |\n|------|------|\n| 包内 `cordis.patch.yml` | `dsh plugin add` 插入的 bundle 层：MCP（`cwd: process.cwd()`）+ `@roarpeng/graphflow/dsh` glue |\n| `$DSH_HOME/cordis.patch.yml`（默认 `~/.dsh`） | `graphflow install` 写的 home overlay |\n| `$DSH_HOME/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md` | 本 Skill（install 复制）；glue 也会在运行时 `ctx.skills.register` |\n\n**用法：** 第一轮先 `mcp__graphflow__graphflow_context`（`rootDir` = 仓库绝对路径）。不要在 patch 里写死 `GRAPHFLOW_WORKSPACE_ROOT`。走了 `graphflow_run` 后必须 `graphflow_report_outcome`。会话结束时 glue 会 best-effort 关闭 pending episode（`GRAPHFLOW_AUTO_CAPTURE=0` 可关）。VS Code 图谱面板 / Workbench Tree 不在 dsh 上。\n\n---",
        "signatureHash": "52d0f7db"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "symbol:.graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md:78f1c86d",
      "type": "Symbol",
      "content": "chunk chunk: Core Context Tools (Highest Frequency) (exported) @.graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md:154",
      "metadata": {
        "name": "chunk: Core Context Tools (Highest Frequency)",
        "kind": "chunk",
        "exported": true,
        "line": 154,
        "file": ".graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md",
        "signature": "| Tool | Purpose | Call Frequency |\n|------|---------|---------------|\n| `graphflow_context` | Preview compressed context (query), expand anchor (anchorId), or archive/recall oversized outputs (content/handle) | **Highest** - default first step |",
        "signatureHash": "269d467a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "symbol:.graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md:d4f78d78",
      "type": "Symbol",
      "content": "chunk chunk: Planning Tools (High Frequency) (exported) @.graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md:160",
      "metadata": {
        "name": "chunk: Planning Tools (High Frequency)",
        "kind": "chunk",
        "exported": true,
        "line": 160,
        "file": ".graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md",
        "signature": "| Tool | Purpose | Call Frequency |\n|------|---------|---------------|\n| `graphflow_plan` | Multi-step task decomposition & DAG (mode='simple' or 'insight') | High - before complex work |\n| `graphflow_run` | Plan + context package (bridge mode) | Medium - full task packaging |\n| `graphflow_report_outcome` | Report bridge-mode execution outcome back | Medium - close the learning loop |\n| `graphflow_insight` | Submit or merge agent insights | Medium - no external LLM API |",
        "signatureHash": "a49c9aa2"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "symbol:.graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md:8957716d",
      "type": "Symbol",
      "content": "chunk chunk: Graph Management Tools (Medium Frequency) (exported) @.graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md:169",
      "metadata": {
        "name": "chunk: Graph Management Tools (Medium Frequency)",
