        "signatureHash": "2bbc03f4"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "symbol:.graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md:74ea4ffa",
      "type": "Symbol",
      "content": "chunk chunk: Single File Index (fastest) (exported) @.graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md:382",
      "metadata": {
        "name": "chunk: Single File Index (fastest)",
        "kind": "chunk",
        "exported": true,
        "line": 382,
        "file": ".graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md",
        "signature": "```\ngraphflow_index(filePath: string, configPath?: string)\n```\n- Index just one file\n- Perfect for onSave hooks\n- Skips unchanged files automatically",
        "signatureHash": "8997d0c1"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "symbol:.graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md:5d52b439",
      "type": "Symbol",
      "content": "chunk chunk: Full Rebuild (slow but clean) (exported) @.graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md:390",
      "metadata": {
        "name": "chunk: Full Rebuild (slow but clean)",
        "kind": "chunk",
        "exported": true,
        "line": 390,
        "file": ".graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md",
        "signature": "```\ngraphflow_index(mode: \"full\", rootDir?: string, configPath?: string)\n```\n- Clears ALL cached data\n- Full re-index from scratch\n- Use only when graph is corrupted or very stale",
        "signatureHash": "8350b730"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "symbol:.graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md:cd44f5a0",
      "type": "Symbol",
      "content": "chunk chunk: Inspect Graph State (exported) @.graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md:398",
      "metadata": {
        "name": "chunk: Inspect Graph State",
        "kind": "chunk",
        "exported": true,
        "line": 398,
        "file": ".graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md",
        "signature": "```\ngraphflow_diagnose(nodeLimit?, edgeLimit?, rootDir?)\n```\n- Check graph size, file count, symbol count\n- Verify indexing worked correctly\n- Sample nodes to verify quality\n- Also shows provider health and token savings\n\n---",
        "signatureHash": "e70d82ea"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "symbol:.graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md:8d8630",
      "type": "Symbol",
