        "signatureHash": "850ddcf6"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "symbol:.graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md:e96a6ef3",
      "type": "Symbol",
      "content": "chunk chunk: Context quality is poor (exported) @.graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md:655",
      "metadata": {
        "name": "chunk: Context quality is poor",
        "kind": "chunk",
        "exported": true,
        "line": 655,
        "file": ".graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md",
        "signature": "1. Try more specific query terms\n2. Check if symbols are indexed (diagnose)\n3. Run `graphflow_index(mode=\"full\")` if the graph may be stale",
        "signatureHash": "14ff3544"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "symbol:.graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md:3aecf5f5",
      "type": "Symbol",
      "content": "chunk chunk: Tool errors / configuration issues (exported) @.graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md:660",
      "metadata": {
        "name": "chunk: Tool errors / configuration issues",
        "kind": "chunk",
        "exported": true,
        "line": 660,
        "file": ".graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md",
        "signature": "1. Run `graphflow_diagnose` to check provider health\n2. Verify config file exists at specified path\n3. Check workspace root is correct",
        "signatureHash": "9c9eeb1a"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "symbol:.graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md:1eaa3a12",
      "type": "Symbol",
      "content": "chunk chunk: Want to share graph with teammates (exported) @.graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md:665",
      "metadata": {
        "name": "chunk: Want to share graph with teammates",
        "kind": "chunk",
        "exported": true,
        "line": 665,
        "file": ".graphflow/skills/graphflow/SKILL.md",
        "signature": "1. Export: `graphflow_artifact(mode=\"export\")`\n2. Send the artifact file\n3. Teammate imports: `graphflow_artifact(mode=\"import\")`\n\n---",
